== Trivia ==
* {{i|Obsessed Fan}} behaves similarly to Shade before the disappearance, but with a longer delay on following Isaac's movements.
* If playing as {{C|Black Judas}} or {{C|Tainted Judas}}, the shade familiar will have red eyes instead of white ones.
* Shade's pickup quote may be a reference to the horror film "It Follows".

